Haa....<br>
Jab tisri shaban ko aya gul-e-Zahra (sa)<br>
Shabbir (as) ko godi me Muhammad (saws) ne uthaya<br>
Haddar jo khushi se rukh-e-masoom ko dekha <br>
Itne me sada dar pe yeh Jibreel (as) ki aayi<br>
Ya saiyadi qurbaan duhayi hai duhayi<br>
<br>
Kehte Jibreel(as) laya hu mehzar Ya Nabi salamalayka 3<br>
<br>
1) Loh-e-mehfooz ek ek satar laya hu<br>
Ek tehrir hai purdard magar laya hu<br>
Ek safar nama-e-magh mu-e-jigar laya <br>
Din khushi hai magar ghum ki khabar laya hu<br>
Dil me hai khanjar Loha zaba'n par<br>
<br>
Saiyadi -3 salamalayka<br>
<br>
2)Sath mehzar ke me wo khaak-e-shifa laya hu <br>
Saari duniya ke liye ghum ki dawa laya hu<br>
Umme Salma(sa) ki zaaefi ka asa laya hu <br>
Yani rumaal me maqtal hi chhupa laya hu<br>
ispe girega khoon-e-bahattar<br>
<br>
Saiyadi -3 salamalayka<br>
<br>
3)Sunke Jibreel(as) ki faryad Muhammad (saws)ne kaha kya hai mehzar me likha-2<br>
mujhko sunao to Zara<br>
Roke kehne laga Jibreel(as)meri jaan fida<br>
Aapke pyaare nawase ka shahadatnama<br>
Karbobala main jaayga dilbar<br>
<br>
Saiyadi-3 salamalayka<br>
<br>
4)Bole Jibreel(as) padho mehzar-e-ghum bade salam<br>
Isme shamil hai shahido ke asiro ke bhi naam<br>
Akraba ahl-e-haram chand kanizo aur gulam<br>
Koi maqtal me rahega to koi jaayga shaam<br>
Koi hai be sar koi khule sar<br>
<br>
Saiyadi-3 salamalayka<br>
<br>
5)Roz-e-jumma hai likha aur san iksath hijri<br>
Aap ke pyaare nawase ki shahadat hogi<br>
 Aap honge na Hasan(as) honge na Zahra(sa)-O-Ali(as)<br>
Sunke Halmin ki sadae bhi na aayga koi<br>
Hoga akela naaz sh-e-Haidar(as)<br>
<br>
Saiyadi-3 jaan Hussain(as)-3<br>
<br>
6)Ya Nabi(saws) aapki ummat yeh sitam dhaygi<br>
Jab su-e-Karbobala Shah(as) ko bulwaygi<br>
Aapki aar Madine me na reh paygi<br>
Aapke baad yeh duniya hi badal jaygi<br>
Jaayge maqtal chhordh ke jab ghar <br>
<br>
Saiyadi-3 jaan Hussain(as)-3<br>
<br>
7)Joun(as)-o-Hur(as) aur Habib(as) ibne Mazahir Asadi<br>
Kaise jaabaz wafadar hai Wehbe kalani<br>
Qasim(as)-o-Akbar(as)-o-<br>
Abbas(as) alamdar-e-jari<br>
Haye Asghar(as)-o-Aun(as)-o-<br>
Muhamma(as) bhi hai kamsin hi sahi<br>
Shamil-e-mehzar hai yahi lashkar<br>
<br>
Saiyadi-3 salamalayka<br>
<br>
8)Haye ab dekhiye Jibreel(as) ki aakho'n se yeh manzar<br>
Ashur ki woh subeh azan-e-Ali Akbar(as)<br>
Ek pyase ko har simt se ghere hai sitamgar<br>
Wo naiza wo paikan wo talwar wo khangar <br>
Maqtal ke wo muazir ka Laasha sar-e-maqtal <br>
Barchi ka nishaa'n sine pe ek tuta hua pal<br>
Talwar se ek turbat-e-besheer ba nana<br>
Turbat pe phir ek soya hua chand chhupana<br>
Phir kaapte hoto se yeh zamee'n ko yeh batana <br>
Asghar(as) tera mehma'n ise jhoola jhula na<br>
Pani jo maya sar na hua haya duhai <br>
Ashko rida turbat-e-Asghar(as) chadhai<br>
Wo asr ka hangam ghadhi qatl ki <br>
Jab Shimr(la)ne ek pyase pe talwar chalai<br>
Ek ret ke tire pe gayi Zahra(sa) ki <br>
Maqtal me behen ro ti rahi <br>
Naize pe bhai<br>
Manzar wo baya'n kaise kare "Mesum o Mazhar"<br>
Baba se kaha Fatema Zahra(as) yeh rokar<br>
Are loot jayga jab dasht-e-bawa me mera ghar<br>
Roe go kaun bhala mere bachche jakar<br>
Beti se farmane lage Ahmad-e-Mukhtar <br>
Ta hashr ise roe ge duniya me azadar